# Event Processing Pipeline

Every telemetry event must pass through the following pipeline.

No event should bypass any mandatory validation stage.

Pipeline:

1. Read event from shared memory
2. Validate event header
3. Verify sequence number
4. Verify payload size
5. Verify integrity
6. Decode payload
7. Parse metadata
8. Normalize fields
9. Classify event
10. Enrich event
11. Correlate with previous events
12. Detect anomalies
13. Determine event importance
14. Decide whether to retain or discard
15. Serialize into internal telemetry representation
16. Export to OpenTelemetry
17. Write to persistent storage
18. Update statistics
19. Remove event from buffer
20. Release associated resources

Every stage should expose timing metrics for performance analysis.

